  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&apos;s Budget Support Program for Samoa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Budget Support  provides Samoa with budget certainty and control to deliver on its own priorities. Australia&#x2019;s 2022 Assessment of National Systems update affirmed that Samoa&#x2019;s systems are robust and there is a demonstrable commitment to continual improvement and lowering residual fiduciary risks. In partnership with New Zealand, the World Bank, the Asian Development Bank and the European Union, this investment utilizes Samoa&apos;s Joint Policy Action Matrix (JPAM) mechanism to facilitate budget support payments aligned with the delivery of priority policy reforms agreed with Samoa. The Tautai program supports implementation through technical and other wrap-around assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
